# Allowlist: never send local keys, wallets, ledgers, .git or .venv to Docker.
**
!Dockerfile
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!gateway/
gateway/**
!gateway/*.py
!gateway/**/*.py
!scripts/
scripts/**
!scripts/*.py
!scripts/**/*.py
# Final denies also cover sensitive files under re-included source directories.
**/.env*
**/data/**
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.log
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.db
**/*.bak
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
